<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Hyperparameters</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the exact models and score metrics used for each evaluation benchmark in table <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix C Hyperparameters ‣ Test-Time Scaling with Diffusion Language Models via Reward-Guided Stitching" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span><span id="A3.T6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Metrics used for each evaluation task</span>. All tasks were evaluated zero-shot, using 4 generations, and with a generation length of 512. Strict match is implemented using the math-verify library <span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note"><span id="footnote3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:111%;">3</span></span>
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
          <span id="footnote3.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:111%;">github.com/huggingface/Math-Verify</span></span></span></span> and exact match uses string matching equality.</figcaption>
