</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use three prompt templates for the math reasoning benchmarks:</p>
</div>
<div id="A8.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="177.86" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 177.86" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,177.86) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#468CC0;" fill="#468CC0" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.6 L 0 174.27 C 0 176.25 1.61 177.86 3.6 177.86 L 473.78 177.86 C 475.77 177.86 477.38 176.25 477.38 174.27 L 477.38 3.6 C 477.38 1.61 475.77 0 473.78 0 L 3.6 0 C 1.61 0 0 1.61 0 3.6 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 3.6 L 0.83 137.89 L 476.55 137.89 L 476.55 3.6 C 476.55 2.07 475.31 0.83 473.78 0.83 L 3.6 0.83 C 2.07 0.83 0.83 2.07 0.83 3.6 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.07 146.11)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.36em;--ltx-fo-height:1.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="30.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.98)" width="392.42"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:28.36em;">
<span id="A8.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Maths: Diffusion Proposer Prompt (Generating Reasoning Traces)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.07 16.53)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.61em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="112.58" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.12)" width="451.23"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.61em;">
<span id="A8.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">System:<span id="A8.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span><pre id="A8.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
You are a math expert. You will be given a question to solve.
Wrap the final answer in a \boxed{}.
Respond in the following format:
&lt;reasoning&gt;
Your reasoning here
&lt;/reasoning&gt;
&lt;answer&gt;
\boxed{...}
&lt;/answer&gt;
</pre>
<span id="A8.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User:<span id="A8.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> {PROBLEM}</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A8.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A8.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="193.7" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 193.7" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,193.7) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#468CC0;" fill="#468CC0" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.6 L 0 190.1 C 0 192.09 1.61 193.7 3.6 193.7 L 473.78 193.7 C 475.77 193.7 477.38 192.09 477.38 190.1 L 477.38 3.6 C 477.38 1.61 475.77 0 473.78 0 L 3.6 0 C 1.61 0 0 1.61 0 3.6 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F7F7F7;" fill="#F7F7F7" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 3.6 L 0.83 170.33 L 476.55 170.33 L 476.55 3.6 C 476.55 2.07 475.31 0.83 473.78 0.83 L 3.6 0.83 C 2.07 0.83 0.83 2.07 0.83 3.6 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.07 178.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:28.36em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="392.42"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
