</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.07 15.76)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.61em;--ltx-fo-height:10.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="145.02" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 142.33)" width="451.23"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A8.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.61em;">
<span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">System:<span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span><pre id="A8.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \\boxed{}.
</pre>
<span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User:<span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Problem: {PROBLEM}
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.0pt;">
</span>Assistant:<span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> {ANSWER} with <span id="A8.p3.pic1.2.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;extra_0&gt;</span> inserted after each step.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
